---
// Homepage blueprint section 9. Serious editorial layout. The portrait
// arrives from Fred's Midjourney run (family-generations.png); until
// then the frame carries an abstract generational gradient.
---

<section class="story" data-surface="editorial">
  <div class="story-inner">
    <div class="story-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="story-placeholder">
        <span class="mono">PORTRAIT IN EDITORIAL REVIEW</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="story-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Featured story</p>
      <h2>The Family Planning 143 Million Generations Ahead</h2>
      <p>
        The Hendersons of Marietta, Georgia have started an education fund,
        a trust, and a solar continuity pledge. Their financial advisor
        described the third as the only one with a truly long horizon, and
        the only one he was not legally permitted to comment on.
      </p>
      <a class="story-link mono" href="/news/donor-stories">Read their story →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story {
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
  }

  .story-inner {
    max-width: var(--page-wide);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-7) var(--space-4);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .story-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }

  .story-visual {
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .story-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(600px 300px at 70% 20%, rgba(224, 163, 46, 0.35), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(160deg, var(--navy-800), var(--navy-950));
    color: #7a879c;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  }

  h2 { font-size: var(--text-2xl); max-width: 20ch; }

  .story-copy p { color: var(--gray-700); }

  .story-link {
    color: var(--gold-300);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .story-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
